WHERE BRENDA DATA APPEARS IN THIS REPOSITORY

  Tests/fixtures/brenda_*.html
      Eleven HTML fixtures containing rows captured live from BRENDA enzyme
      pages, used to test the parser without hitting the network.

  Tests/fixtures/recorded/brenda_*.html.gz
      Whole BRENDA enzyme pages, stored unmodified and gzipped. Whenever the
      API server's tests run, each recorded page is served in place of
      BRENDA's live page for that EC number, whether or not BRENDA is
      reachable; an EC number with no recorded page is fetched live. Only
